      "uid": "zhcn:e601492445c83ef0bdeceb75",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一位赢得“日本C”的日本选手，\n为日本赛马娘界带来新气象的\n葛城王牌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cad72fb4d9507730135805761145725cbee2d0c2da4ca29b7f71302380cacf20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
