      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没想到能再次看到王牌跑步的样子……！\n粉丝感谢祭真是棒透了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e4f2b10886208ba69ddb3d56efa5db5003021ce606ecb1f426a430195033544",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
